{"words": [{"text": "۞ إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(is) not"}, {"text": "يَسْتَحْىِۦٓ", "translation": "ashamed"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "يَضْرِبَ", "translation": "set forth"}, {"text": "مَثَلًۭا", "translation": "an example"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "(like) even"}, {"text": "بَعُوضَةًۭ", "translation": "(of) a mosquito"}, {"text": "فَمَا", "translation": "and (even) something"}, {"text": "فَوْقَهَا ۚ", "translation": "above it"}, {"text": "فَأَمَّا", "translation": "Then as for"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "فَيَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "[thus] they will know"}, {"text": "أَنَّهُ", "translation": "that it"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "translation": "(is) the truth"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّهِمْ ۖ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَأَمَّا", "translation": "And as for"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "disbelieved"}, {"text": "فَيَقُولُونَ", "translation": "[thus] they will say"}, {"text": "مَاذَآ", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "أَرَادَ", "translation": "(did) intend"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِهَـٰذَا", "translation": "by this"}, {"text": "مَثَلًۭا ۘ", "translation": "example"}, {"text": "يُضِلُّ", "translation": "He lets go astray"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "by it"}, {"text": "كَثِيرًۭا", "translation": "many"}, {"text": "وَيَهْدِى", "translation": "and He guides"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "by it"}, {"text": "كَثِيرًۭا ۚ", "translation": "many"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "يُضِلُّ", "translation": "He lets go astray"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "translation": "by it"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ", "translation": "the defiantly disobedient"}], "sahih": "Indeed, Allāh is not timid to present an example - that of a mosquito or what is smaller1 than it. And those who have believed know that it is the truth from their Lord. But as for those who disbelieve, they say, \"What did Allāh intend by this as an example?\" He misleads many thereby and guides many thereby. And He misleads not except the defiantly disobedient,"}